WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.451 line:72%
First, a computer should not
take an irreversible

2
00:00:03.451 --> 00:00:06.989 line:72%
action until an independent
check confirms it is safe.

3
00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:10.785 line:72%
Second, it should try the
cheapest method first and

4
00:00:10.785 --> 00:00:14.222 line:72%
wake a large AI model only when
simpler tools miss.

5
00:00:14.582 --> 00:00:19.419 line:72%
Third, every decision is written
to a receipt with the energy it
used,

6
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.422 line:72%
so anyone can audit it later.
